Scaffolding templates in `assets/templates/`:

| Template | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `reducer_test.go.tmpl` | Table-driven reducer tests with invariants |
| `component_test.go.tmpl` | Component model tests (keyboard, mouse, commands, view) |
